5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to learn about how the work gets done. I will look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'll be keeping an eye on the money. I'm going to check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe we should see how our previous efforts have aged. I will look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I am concerned about the long-term management of the site. I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll focus on the actual behavior of the site. I will look into the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
